---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="PRIVACY POLICY - DJTOBINN">
  <main
    class="w-full min-h-screen bg-[#050505] text-white py-24 sm:py-32 px-6 sm:px-12 flex flex-col gap-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto"
  >
    <div class="border-b border-white/20 pb-8 flex flex-col items-start gap-8">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/50 border border-white/20 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-white hover:text-black hover:border-white transition-all"
      >
        RETURN TO MAIN
      </a>
      <h1
        class="display-text text-5xl sm:text-7xl uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[0.8] m-0"
      >
        PRIVACY POLICY
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div
      class="font-sans text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/80 flex flex-col gap-10 font-light"
    >
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight font-medium">
          1. Data Collection
        </h2>
        <p>
          We collect only the bare minimum data necessary to process booking
          requests. This may include your name, email address, and event details
          submitted via direct communication. We do not use invasive tracking
          pixels or third-party analytics cookies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight font-medium">
          2. Data Usage
        </h2>
        <p>
          Any information you provide is used strictly for direct communication
          regarding gigs, events, and bookings. We do not sell, rent, or share
          your contact information with external corporations or third-party
          advertisers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight font-medium">
          3. Security Protocols
        </h2>
        <p>
          Communications sent via email are stored securely using standard
          encryption. However, be advised that transmission over the public
          internet is never 100% secure. Do not transmit sensitive financial
          data via unencrypted channels.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight font-medium">
          4. Third-Party Platforms
        </h2>
        <p>
          Our site contains links to external platforms such as Instagram and
          SoundCloud. Once you leave this domain, you are subject to the privacy
          policies and terms of those respective platforms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-white/20 pt-10">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight font-medium">
          Contact
        </h2>
        <p>
          For any privacy concerns or data removal requests, contact: <a
            href="mailto:booking@tobinn.com"
            class="text-white hover:underline font-medium">booking@tobinn.com</a
          >
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
